// Ch13 B04 optional: the outer moorings at dusk. Kerrid STANDING among the polers, an oil lamp on a pole.
// Rhen can stand with him. Kerrid says nothing for a long time; then a stair-watch captain's eye on water
// that won't move. A poler offers him a bowl of rice; he sets it down untouched (he never eats).
title: ch13_moorings_kerrid
location: ch13/ansedra
---
@mark rhen outer_moorings_rhen walk
@wait 6.0
Kerrid [neutral]: They pole well here. #line:ch13_moorings_001
@wait 2.0
Kerrid [cold]: Too well. #line:ch13_moorings_002 #tn:"He means: the water is being held unnaturally still."
@anim kerrid set_down rice_bowl
@wait 2.0
<<set $ch13_sat_at_moorings = true>>
===
